Instituto de Física, Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Sul. [Institution-hosted support text, August 2014 filename](https://www.if.ufrgs.br/fis182/Livro_AGOSTO2014.pdf).

An optional Portuguese companion for reading familiar introductory electrical and magnetic topics in the vocabulary of a Brazilian university course. Compare its named sections with the complete UFJF notes and the introductory books, preserving the meaning of symbols rather than equating chapter numbers across editions.

Indexed institutional title information was available on 29 October 2026; direct retrieval timed out. The filename is a version clue, not independent proof of publication year, complete authorship or licence. Full-page inspection and general redistribution/adaptation rights are not claimed. Use the institution's actual file and title page when forming a bibliographic citation. No copy is bundled.

